<title>USA: Vidamed says names Richard Brounstein CFO.</title>
<headline>Vidamed says names Richard Brounstein CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vidamed Inc said Thursday that it appointed Richard Brounstein as vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Brounstein replaces James Heisch who was appointed president and chief executive officer of the company.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Vidamed, Brounstein was a vice president chief financial officer of MedaSonics Inc.</p>
